Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every day, roads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:02.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,catch things that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:03.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,are completely out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.45,0:00:04.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:05.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,A car crossing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:07.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,into oncoming traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.59,0:00:08.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,A twenty-ton boulder
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:09.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,falling toward
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:10.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:11.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Even a jet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.51,0:00:12.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,that couldn't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:13.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:14.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stopping them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:15.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:16.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stopping them without
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:17.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,hurting anyone is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:18.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.09,0:00:19.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here are seven
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:21.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,clever ways engineers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:22.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,do it, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:22.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,the one trick
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:23.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,almost all of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:24.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,them share.
